  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>הַדִּבּוּר</b> -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נוֹגֵעַ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פּוֹגֵעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>הַשִּׁירָה</b>&nbsp;-<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עוֹטֶפֶת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לוֹטֶפֶת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּאִוְשָׁה שֶׁבֵּין הַמִּלִּים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שְׁתִיקָה בֵּינוֹת לַתֵּיבוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵלֶם אַחֲרֵי הַקּוֹלוֹת.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נסה השבוע <strong data-end=\"57\" data-start=\"26\">להקשיב לשתיקות שבין הצלילים</strong> - שם מתרחשת לא פעם המוזיקה האמיתית.</span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַמִּלִּים מַשְׁמִיעוֹת קוֹל - הַשְּׁתִיקָה נוֹתֶנֶת לָהֶן מַשְׁמָעוּת</span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><strong data-end=\"83\" data-start=\"67\">אבנר מבורגוס</strong>, תלמיד הרמב״ן שפרש מיהדותו והתנצר (נודע גם כאלפונסו דה ואיאדוליד), ביקש מרבו לדעת היכן רמוז גורלו בתורה. הרמב״ן פתח בפרשת האזינו והראה את הפסוק <em data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"228\">“אָמַ<span style=\"font-size: large;\">רְ</span>תִּי אַפְ<span style=\"font-size: large;\">אֵ</span>יהֶם אַשְׁ<span style=\"font-size: large;\">בִּ</span>יתָה מֵּאֱ<span style=\"font-size: large;\">נ</span>וֹשׁ זִכְרָם”</em>. האותיות השלישיות יוצרות את שמו <strong data-end=\"326\" data-start=\"318\">אבנר</strong>, ואמר לו: סופך לטבוע בים ולהישכח. כך אכן היה.</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>'</span><span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><b>הַאֲזִינוּ</b></span>' / '</span><span><b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">אַצִּיתוּ</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ הקשבה, שמיעה - ציתות וציות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">צּוּר</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">תַּקִּיפָא</b>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">קשה כסלע, חזק - תקיף</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">שִׁחֵת</b>' / '<span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><b>חַבִּיל</b></span>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ הרס, פגע - חבל</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">בְּהַפְרִידוֹ</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">בְּפָרָשׁוּתֵיהּ</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;בהרחיקו, בנתקו - בהפרשתו</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">יָבִינוּ</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">סַבַּרוּ</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ הבנה, הגיון - סברה</span></li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/15fe203cd5d2963429.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/7273aba2a0b951b71b.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/7273aba2a0b951b71b.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַשִּׁירָה דָּמְמָה - אַךְ הֵדֶיהָ עוֹד פּוֹעֲמִים</span></div></div></div>"
}
